# emerald: init.rc starts the "console" shell on every debuggable build
# (on init && property:ro.debuggable=1), and AMS then posts the ongoing "Serial console enabled" notification
# (showConsoleNotificationIfActive checks init.svc.console=running at the end of boot). emerald boots with
# console=ttynull, so that shell is attached to nothing. Stop it as soon as it runs.
on property:init.svc.console=running
    stop console
